      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_health_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "8ED00DD10C367A3A",
      "text": "我進到了大家都在自習的教室，\\n擅自上起了健康教育課，\\r\\n真是成了個十足的可疑份子～[VAR 0x0114(0028)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
